:Compute KL divergence\nand PSI;
note right
  **Source:**
  - src/.../drift/__init__.py (985 lines)

  **Class:**
  - DriftDetector (lines 300-550)

  **Algorithms:**
  - KL Divergence (symmetric):
    KL_sym = (KL(P||Q) + KL(Q||P)) / 2
  - Population Stability Index:
    PSI = Σ (P(i) - Q(i)) * log(P(i)/Q(i))

  **Thresholds:**
  - KL WARNING: 0.15
  - KL CRITICAL: 0.30
  - PSI WARNING: 0.10
  - PSI CRITICAL: 0.25
end note

